<item>
<title>Health</title>
<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=14794</link>
<description>Trained for health, found the table with all the values in quite easily, but it moved each game.. BAST !!  So, debugged for a day and found the bit of code that draws the health bars on the screen for each player, so I hooked a patch into that. My patch gets the pointer to the player data in s1, so I just fill in the appropriate offsets. So each of the following cheat is basically a SW/H at,0x??(s1) It should automatically sort out these cheats for any player who's health bars are draw on the screen.</description>
